  "body_html": "<h1>Strict Dominance</h1>\n<p>A strategy $s_i$ strictly dominates another strategy $s'_i$ for player $i$ if, for\nevery profile $\\sigma$ of the other players, playing $s_i$ yields strictly higher\npayoff:</p>\n<p>$$\\forall \\sigma, \\quad u_i(\\sigma[i \\mapsto s'_i]) &lt; u_i(\\sigma[i \\mapsto s_i]).$$</p>",
